          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yeni öğeler eklemeyi gördük. Şimdi oyuncular düğmeye tıkladığında bu oyun HUD'sinin yaptığı gibi öğeleri nasıl kaldıracağını öğrenelim.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;hud&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h2&gt;Game HUD&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;toggleEnemies()&quot; id=&quot;toggle&quot;&gt;Hide&#xA;   Enemies&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;Slime&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Slime:&lt;/strong&gt; HP 10&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;Bat&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bat:&lt;/strong&gt; HP 6&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   const firstID = &quot;Slime&quot;;&#xA;   const secondID = &quot;Bat&quot;;&#xA;   &#xA;   function toggleEnemies() {&#xA;    const button = document.getElementById(&quot;toggle&quot;);&#xA;    const hudElement = document.getElementById(&quot;hud&quot;);&#xA;    if (toggle.innerHTML === &quot;Show Enemies&quot;) {&#xA;     const p1 = document.createElement(&quot;p&quot;);&#xA;     p1.innerHTML = &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Slime:&lt;/strong&gt; HP 10&quot;;&#xA;     p1.id = firstID;&#xA;     const p2 = document.createElement(&quot;p&quot;);&#xA;     p2.innerHTML = &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Bat:&lt;/strong&gt; HP 6&quot;;&#xA;     p2.id = secondID;&#xA;     hudElement.appendChild(p1);&#xA;     hudElement.appendChild(p2);&#xA;     button.innerHTML = &quot;Hide Enemies&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     const p1 = document.getElementById(firstID);&#xA;     const p2 = document.getElementById(secondID);&#xA;     hudElement.removeChild(p1);&#xA;     hudElement.removeChild(p2);&#xA;     button.innerHTML = &quot;Show Enemies&quot;;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kaldırmak istediğimiz öğeyi ve onun üst öğesini belirlememiz gerekiyor. Öğeleri belirlemek için <code>id=\"hud\"</code> ve <code>id=\"enemy\"</code> kodlarını kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;hud&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game HUD\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h2\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"id\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;enemy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Slime: HP 10\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;script.js&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"undefined\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"script\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"d\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>id</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve sonra <code>\"hud\"</code>, <code>id=\"enemy\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
